  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you mess with fate, the response is particularly strong.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Manipulate fortune class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> All bonuses, and penalties, granted by the tell fortune class feature are increased by +1. This does not apply to rolls on Table: Tell Fortune Outcomes that were triggered by spending fate points.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
